  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "When constructed, the Battle Copter is built at level 15. This counts as 15 levels towards the level 5 upgrade requirement of the B.O.B Control (which requires the Battle Copter and Battle Machine to be upgraded to a combined level of 45), rather than just one.",
    "The Battle Copter is the second Hero unlocked in the Builder Base. It requires a level 8 Builder Hall and 2,500,000 Builder Elixir to construct.",
    "When deployed, the Battle Copter will start with the ability charged up to level 1. It takes about 40 seconds to charge up to level 3 from the moment the ability is activated.",
    "The Battle Copter has an ability known as Bomb Rush. When used, the Battle Copter regenerates some health and rushes forward to its target building to throw a bomb at close range, dealing moderate area damage. This ability is improved every 5th level."
  ],
